    [202256]={status="ok",name="Privateer's Ornate Pistol",quality=2,tip="Item Level 12Binds when picked upRangedGun\n 11 - 21 Damage\n Speed 1.90\n(8.42 damage per second)+0 AgilityClasses: RogueEquip: Gain the Quick Draw ability:Draw your ranged weapon and fire a quick shot at an enemy, causing normal ranged weapon damage and reducing the target's movement speed by 50% for 6 sec. Awards 1 combo point.Quick Draw benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike.Sell Price: 2 97"},
    [205218]={status="ok",name="Libram of Discovery",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicLibramClasses: PaladinRequires Level 5Engrave your cloak with the Soul Siphon rune:Increases health drained or damage done by your Drain Life, Drain Soul, and Wrack spells by 20%.\"Achieve a state of Inspiration by slaying 5 foes, then use to learn a new ability.\""},
    [205420]={status="ok",name="Libram of Judgement",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1Binds when picked upUniqueRelicLibramClasses: PaladinEngrave your gloves with the Crusader Strike rune:\"Learn a new ability after unleashing 10 seals onto your enemies\"",undatamined=true},
    [206376]={status="ok",name="Bulwark Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanRequires Level 3Engrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:Each time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.In addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond (60 * 5). Lasts 15 sec.\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\""},
    [206381]={status="ok",name="Dyadic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanEngrave your chest or robe with the Overload rune:Gives your Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning spells a 30% chance to cast a second, similar spell on the same target at no additional cost that causes half damage and no threat.\"Learn a new ability after receiving Nature damage 10 times.\""},
    [206382]={status="ok",name="Tempest Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 10Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanEngrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:The caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water. When a spell, melee, or ranged attack hits the caster or when one of the caster's healing spells gets a critical result, 2% of maximum mana is restored to the caster, expending one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts 10 min.Only one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time.\"Learn a new ability after hitting 10 non-player enemies with 3 different elements (Nature, Frost, Fire).\"",undatamined=true},
    [206383]={status="ok",name="Lithic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanRequires Level 3Engrave your pants with the Earth Shield rune:Protects the target with an earthen shield, reducing casting or channeling time lost when damaged by 30% and causing attacks to heal the shielded target for [28 * (29.888200 + 0.690312 * 60 + 0.136267 * 60 * 60) / 100]. This effect can only occur once every few seconds. 9 charges. Lasts 10 min. Earth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time.\"Learn a new ability after blocking 20 attacks with your shield.\""},
    [206384]={status="ok",name="Astral Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanRequires Level 3\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",undatamined=true},
    [206385]={status="ok",name="Clastic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanRequires Level 3Engrave your pants with the Way of Earth rune:While Rockbiter Weapon is active on your main hand weapon and you have a shield equipped, you deal 65% increased threat, gain 30% increased health, take 10% reduced damage, gain 6% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks, and Earth Shock taunts targets to attack you and has a separate cooldown from other Shock spells but has its range reduced to melee range. However, the range of your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Chain Heal, Healing Wave, and Lava Burst spells is reduced by 20 yards. \"Learn a new ability after defeating 20 enemies with Earth Shock.\""},
    [206386]={status="ok",name="Galvanic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanEngrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:Each time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.In addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond (60 * 5). Lasts 15 sec.\"Learn a new ability after defeating enemies 10 times with Lightning Bolt.\""},
    [206387]={status="ok",name="Kajaric Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 25Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanEngrave your gloves with the Lava Burst rune:You hurl molten lava at the target, dealing (71.4% of Spell Power) Fire damage. If your Flame Shock is on the target, Lava Burst deals 20% increased damage.\"Learn a new ability after taking damage from lava 5 times. (Reduces damage from some sources of lava)\""},
    [206388]={status="ok",name="Sulfurous Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanEngrave your gloves with the Molten Blast rune:Blast up to 10 enemies in a cone in front of you for [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * (14.3% of Spell Power) / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] to [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * (14.3% of Spell Power) / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] Fire damage. This ability generates a high amount of threat. Flame Shock periodic damage has a 10% chance to reset the cooldown on Molten Blast.\"Learn a new ability after defeating 10 enemies with Earth Shock.\""},
    [206389]={status="ok",name="Brimstone Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanRequires Level 3Engrave your belt with the Fire Nova rune:Your Fire Nova Totem spell is replaced with Fire Nova, which causes your current Fire totem to emit damage at its location.\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\""},
    [206390]={status="ok",name="Ichthyan Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanRequires Level 3Engrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:The caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water. When a spell, melee, or ranged attack hits the caster or when one of the caster's healing spells gets a critical result, 2% of maximum mana is restored to the caster, expending one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts 10 min.Only one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time.\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",undatamined=true},
    [206391]={status="ok",name="Syzygic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanRequires Level 3Engrave your bracers with the Riptide rune:Heals a friendly target for (21.4% of Spell Power), an additional (50% of Spell Power) over 15 sec, and increases the effectiveness of your Chain Heal casts directly on that target by 25%.\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",undatamined=true},
    [206954]={status="ok",name="Idol of Ursine Rage",quality=2,tip="Item Level 10Binds when picked upUniqueRelicIdolClasses: DruidEngrave your gloves with the Mangle rune:Mangle the target for 100% normal damage plus 26.\"Learn a new ability after keeping your rage in Bear Form at 50 or higher for 60 seconds\""},
    [208414]={status="ok",name="Lunar Idol",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicIdolClasses: DruidEngrave your chest or robe with the Fury of Stormrage rune:Reduces the mana cost of Wrath by 100% and each time you deal damage with Wrath you have a 12% chance for your next cast of Healing Touch within 15 sec to be instant and castable in any shapeshift form. Allows Wrath to be cast while in Tree of Life form.\"Defeat 6 creatures affected by your Moonfire, then use to learn a new ability.\""},
    [208689]={status="ok",name="Ferocious Idol",quality=2,tip="Item Level 20Binds when picked upUniqueRelicIdolClasses: DruidEngrave your pants with the Savage Roar rune:Requires Cat FormFinishing move that increases Physical damage done by 30% while in Cat Form. Lasts longer per combo point: 1 point : (14 + 0) seconds 2 points: (19 + 0) seconds 3 points: (24 + 0) seconds 4 points: (29 + 0) seconds 5 points: (34 + 0) seconds\"Deal 20 instances of bleeding damage to humanoids, then use this idol to learn a new ability.\""},
